Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Homepage: https://github.com/florian-asche/PiCompose-Package-Driver-Satellite1
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: picompose-driver-satellite1
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Provides: picompose-audio-driver
Conflicts: picompose-audio-driver
Replaces: picompose-audio-driver
Description: PiCompose audio driver marker for the Satellite1
 The package contains no files. It marks the Satellite1 as the audio driver of
 the system. The microphone of the card needs satellite1-rpi-setup 1.5-1 or
 newer, which the PiCompose image installs.
 .
 The driver itself, the kernel and the packages of FutureProofHomes, is not
 part of this package, the PiCompose image installs it.
 .
 The package provides picompose-audio-driver, so only one audio driver package
 can be installed.
